msgid "Row selection mode"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:436
msgid "What the cursor highlights. Select cell (the default): one cell, moved cell by cell - suits a table edited in place. Select row: the whole row - suits a list rows are picked or opened from."
msgstr ""

