msgid "Choice mode"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:443
msgid "Whether the table works as a picker: double-click or Enter hands the current row back to whoever opened the form, instead of opening or editing it, and a Select command leads its command bar. Set automatically on a choice form's list."
msgstr ""

