#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:868
msgid "Header align"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:597
msgid "How the group's title is aligned in its header cell: left, center (the default) or right."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:599
msgid "Whether the group and all its columns are shown. Hidden columns keep their data and can be shown again from code."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:826
msgid "The column's header text. Empty: the synonym of the bound field, or the column's name when nothing is bound. Can be written per language."
