#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:358
msgid "Textedit mode"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:829
msgid "Whether the value can be typed into the cell. Off: it can only be picked with the Select button or cleared. On by default; a read-only column never takes typing."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:831
msgid "How the column shows its cells, written per language: digits after the point, separators, a date pattern. Empty: the bound attribute's format, and without one a number shows as many digits after the point as its type keeps."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:833
msgid "Footer text"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:834
msgid "The text in this column's footer cell, shown when the table's footer is on - a label or a total set from code. Can be written per language."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/tableBox.h:838
msgid "The field of the table's source this column shows and edits. A path through a reference (such as Owner.Description) is shown read-only."
msgstr ""

