#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:67
msgid "How the button is drawn: a button, or a hyperlink - no face and no frame, its caption underlined. Pressed the same way, and its picture, its representation and its command are the same."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:70
msgid "The text on the button. Empty: the bound command's own caption. Can be written per language and changed from code while the form is open."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:72
msgid "What the button shows: text, picture, or both. Auto: what the bound command prefers (Close is a picture alone, Add a picture with text); picture and text when no command is bound."
