#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:79
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:80
msgid "The line under a tile's title - a price, a count, a state. Shown only when the picture location is Tile. Can be written per language and changed from code while the form is open."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:85
msgid "The command a press runs: a form command, a standard command of the form or of one of its tables, or a command of the configuration. A button has no click event of its own - the code goes into the command's handler."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:178
msgid "Static text"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:179
msgid "Markup"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:180
msgid "Kept for older forms and saved with the form; it has no effect - the caption is shown as plain text."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:182
msgid "Kept for older forms and saved with the form; it has no effect. For several lines, put line breaks into the title."
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/frmserver/visualView/ctrl/widgets.h:184
msgid "The caption text. Empty on a bound static text: the bound field's synonym. Can be written per language and changed from code while the form is open."
msgstr ""

